<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Initialization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>very<sp/>first<sp/>step<sp/>for<sp/>initialization<sp/>is<sp/>to<sp/>execute<sp/>the<sp/>mlx_init<sp/>function.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">It<sp/>is<sp/>responsible<sp/>for<sp/>setting<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>GLFW<sp/>windowing<sp/>library<sp/>which<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">creates<sp/>a<sp/>connection<sp/>between<sp/>your<sp/>software<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>display.<sp/>It<sp/>also<sp/>loads<sp/>the<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">OpenGL<sp/>function<sp/>pointers,<sp/>compiling<sp/>the<sp/>shaders<sp/>and<sp/>more.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">It<sp/>returns<sp/>a<sp/>mlx_t*<sp/>which<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>structure<sp/>containing<sp/>the<sp/>current<sp/>window<sp/>instance.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">With<sp/>this<sp/>instance<sp/>you<sp/>can<sp/>manipulate,<sp/>hook<sp/>onto<sp/>and<sp/>control<sp/>what<sp/>happens<sp/>inside<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">your<sp/>window<sp/>instance.<sp/>For<sp/>example<sp/>you<sp/>would<sp/>use<sp/>it<sp/>to<sp/>send<sp/>graphical<sp/>instructions<sp/>such<sp/>as<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">creating<sp/>an<sp/>image,<sp/>which<sp/>is<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>display<sp/>pixel<sp/>data.<sp/>You<sp/>can<sp/>also<sp/>detect<sp/>key</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">interactions<sp/>such<sp/>as<sp/>checking<sp/>if<sp/>the<sp/>W,<sp/>A,<sp/>S<sp/>or<sp/>D<sp/>key<sp/>is<sp/>currently<sp/>being<sp/>pressed.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Function<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Description<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|-------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`mlx_init()`<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Initialize<sp/>and<sp/>run<sp/>a<sp/>new<sp/>window<sp/>instance.<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`mlx_loop()`<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Keep<sp/>the<sp/>window<sp/>open<sp/>as<sp/>long<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>shutdown<sp/>is<sp/>not<sp/>requested.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
