<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">If<sp/>mlx_init()<sp/>fails<sp/>to<sp/>set<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>connection<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>graphical<sp/>system,<sp/>it<sp/>will</highlight></codeline>
