<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>order<sp/>to<sp/>use<sp/>the<sp/>functions<sp/>in<sp/>MLX,<sp/>you&apos;ll<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>link<sp/>it<sp/>with<sp/>your<sp/>application.</highlight></codeline>
