<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>F.A.Q</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Q:<sp/>**_&quot;It&apos;S<sp/>NoT<sp/>In<sp/>ThE<sp/>SuBjeCt!&quot;_**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A:<sp/>So<sp/>what?<sp/>Subjects<sp/>can<sp/>change<sp/>and<sp/>so<sp/>if<sp/>something<sp/>is<sp/>not<sp/>working<sp/>correctly<sp/>it<sp/>should<sp/>be<sp/>replaced.<sp/>Sure<sp/>you<sp/>can<sp/>argue<sp/>this<sp/>point<sp/>but<sp/>you<sp/>can<sp/>also<sp/>be<sp/>the<sp/>reason<sp/>that<sp/>it<sp/>CAN<sp/>be<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>subject<sp/>instead.<sp/>Have<sp/>an<sp/>open<sp/>mind<sp/>:)</highlight></codeline>
