<codeline><highlight class="normal">Q:<sp/>**_&quot;Ok,<sp/>so,<sp/>can<sp/>I<sp/>use<sp/>it<sp/>?&quot;_**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A:<sp/>Officially,<sp/>_no_.<sp/>However,<sp/>ask<sp/>your<sp/>head<sp/>of<sp/>studies<sp/>first<sp/>about<sp/>using<sp/>it,<sp/>see<sp/>what<sp/>they<sp/>think.<sp/>Some<sp/>students<sp/>might<sp/>be<sp/>evangelical<sp/>enthusiasts<sp/>about<sp/>what<sp/>is<sp/>stated<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>subject<sp/>and<sp/>are<sp/>technically<sp/>in<sp/>every<sp/>right<sp/>to<sp/>fail<sp/>you<sp/>as<sp/>long<sp/>as<sp/>this<sp/>library<sp/>is<sp/>not<sp/>endorsed,<sp/>if<sp/>you<sp/>were<sp/>to<sp/>ask<sp/>me<sp/>(W2)<sp/>then<sp/>yes<sp/>why<sp/>not?</highlight></codeline>
